    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55917" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατηγορ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>accusation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.50
			</span></i>, etc.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτία</span>
			(expostulation), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.69
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπαινος</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				84
			</span></i>; opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολογία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1358b11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					6.10
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ὑβρίζοντος κ. ἐποιοῦντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.8.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐγένοντο πολλαὶ τῶν Ἀθηναίων</span>
			<i>charges</i> were made against . . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.1.31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατηγορίαι κατά τινος γεγόνασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					5.147
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ . . ἐπὶ τοῖς πεπραγμένοις
				κατηγορίας ἔχω</span> I am liable to <i>accusation</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.240
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in Logic,
				<i>predication</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1007a35
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>APo.</u>
				84a1
			</span></i>; esp. <i>affirmative predication</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέρησις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>APr.</u>
				52a15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπορον ἐν κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					2.93
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>predicate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1004a29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1028a28
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.23U.
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> more
			freq., <i>category, head of predicables</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Top.</u>
				103b20
			</span></i> (ten), <i><span class="en">
				<u>APo.</u>
				83b16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				225b5
			</span></i> (eight), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1068a8
			</span></i> (seven), cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>EN</u>
				1096a29
			</span></i>.</div>
